#: data/songs.json:artists[farewell].name
msgid "The Cradle Farewell Orchestra"
msgstr "The Cradle Farewell Orchestra"

#: data/songs.json:artists[farewell].genre
msgid "Orchestral"
msgstr "Orquestal"

#: data/songs.json:artists[farewell].bio
msgid "Played one last concert on the launch pad while the ark boarded. Half of them missed the flight on purpose, so the encore was very long."
msgstr "Dio un último concierto en la plataforma de lanzamiento mientras embarcaba el arca. La mitad perdió el vuelo a propósito, así que el bis fue larguísimo."

#: data/songs.json:artists[compactors].name
msgid "The Compactors"
msgstr "The Compactors"

#: data/songs.json:artists[compactors].genre
msgid "Garage pop"
msgstr "Pop de garaje"

#: data/songs.json:artists[compactors].bio
msgid "A four-piece that rehearsed inside a broken trash compactor for the acoustics. They swear the walls only closed in on them once, during a drum solo."
msgstr "Un cuarteto que ensayaba dentro de una compactadora de basura rota por la acústica. Juran que las paredes solo se cerraron una vez, durante un solo de batería."

#: data/songs.json:artists[rustbucket].name
msgid "Lil' Rustbucket"
msgstr "Lil' Rustbucket"

#: data/songs.json:artists[rustbucket].genre
msgid "Chiptune"
msgstr "Chiptune"

#: data/songs.json:artists[rustbucket].bio
msgid "A retired sweeper bot who refused to stop making beats. Every track was recorded on its own diagnostic beeper, between error codes."
msgstr "Un robot barrendero jubilado que se negó a dejar de hacer ritmos. Cada pista se grabó con su propio pitido de diagnóstico, entre códigos de error."

#: data/songs.json:artists[recycle_bin].name
msgid "DJ Recycle Bin"
msgstr "DJ Recycle Bin"

#: data/songs.json:artists[recycle_bin].genre
msgid "Lofi beats"
msgstr "Ritmos lofi"

#: data/songs.json:artists[recycle_bin].bio
msgid "Only samples sounds from the city dump: lids, crinkles, a fridge door with real soul. Released three albums and never once got out of bed for them."
msgstr "Solo samplea sonidos del vertedero de la ciudad: tapas, crujidos, una puerta de nevera con mucho soul. Sacó tres discos sin levantarse nunca de la cama."

#: data/songs.json:artists[pianissimo].name
msgid "Professor Pianissimo"
msgstr "Professor Pianissimo"

#: data/songs.json:artists[pianissimo].genre
msgid "Quiet piano"
msgstr "Piano suave"

#: data/songs.json:artists[pianissimo].bio
msgid "Composes only for empty rooms and sleeping cities. His neighbours filed forty-one noise complaints, all saying the music was too soft to hear properly."
msgstr "Compone solo para habitaciones vacías y ciudades dormidas. Sus vecinos pusieron cuarenta y una quejas por ruido, todas porque la música era demasiado baja."

#: data/songs.json:artists[two_suns].name
msgid "Two Suns Tango Orchestra"
msgstr "Two Suns Tango Orchestra"

#: data/songs.json:artists[two_suns].genre
msgid "Desert dance band"
msgstr "Banda de baile del desierto"

#: data/songs.json:artists[two_suns].bio
msgid "Ochre's hardest-working band: with two suns there is no shade and no siesta, so they just kept playing. The sunglasses are part of the uniform."
msgstr "La banda más trabajadora de Ochre: con dos soles no hay sombra ni siesta, así que siguieron tocando. Las gafas de sol son parte del uniforme."

#: data/songs.json:artists[mirage_bros].name
msgid "The Mirage Brothers"
msgstr "The Mirage Brothers"

#: data/songs.json:artists[mirage_bros].genre
msgid "Heat-haze ambient"
msgstr "Ambient de calima"

#: data/songs.json:artists[mirage_bros].bio
msgid "Nobody is sure how many Mirage Brothers there are. On a hot day the crowd counted seven; on a cold one, just Gary."
msgstr "Nadie sabe cuántos Mirage Brothers hay. En un día caluroso el público contó siete; en uno frío, solo a Gary."

#: data/songs.json:artists[salty_buoys].name
msgid "The Salty Buoys"
msgstr "The Salty Buoys"

#: data/songs.json:artists[salty_buoys].genre
msgid "Island pop"
msgstr "Pop isleño"

#: data/songs.json:artists[salty_buoys].bio
msgid "A beach band that played on floating junk rafts, drifting between islands mid-song. Their tour schedule depended entirely on the tide."
msgstr "Una banda de playa que tocaba sobre balsas de chatarra flotante, derivando entre islas en mitad de la canción. Su gira dependía por completo de la marea."

#: data/songs.json:artists[barnacle_trio].name
msgid "Barnacle Bossa Trio"
msgstr "Barnacle Bossa Trio"

#: data/songs.json:artists[barnacle_trio].genre
msgid "Bossa and lofi"
msgstr "Bossa y lofi"

#: data/songs.json:artists[barnacle_trio].bio
msgid "Three mellow players who refused to evacuate until the set was finished. The set was four hours long. They caught the last pod, still humming."
msgstr "Tres músicos tranquilos que se negaron a evacuar hasta terminar el set. El set duraba cuatro horas. Cogieron la última cápsula, aún tarareando."

#: data/songs.json:artists[streetlights].name
msgid "Static & the Streetlights"
msgstr "Static & the Streetlights"

#: data/songs.json:artists[streetlights].genre
msgid "Icy synthpop"
msgstr "Synthpop helado"

#: data/songs.json:artists[streetlights].bio
msgid "A synth duo who powered their gigs by plugging into whichever harbour lamp still worked. The power company billed them for the whole ice shelf."
msgstr "Un dúo de sintes que enchufaba sus conciertos a la farola del puerto que aún funcionara. La eléctrica les cobró toda la plataforma de hielo."

#: data/songs.json:artists[mittens].name
msgid "Mittens McKenzie"
msgstr "Mittens McKenzie"

#: data/songs.json:artists[mittens].genre
msgid "Frozen piano"
msgstr "Piano helado"

#: data/songs.json:artists[mittens].bio
msgid "Rime's beloved pianist, who played every concert in mittens. Critics called it muffled genius. Mittens called it frostbite prevention."
msgstr "La pianista favorita de Rime, que tocaba cada concierto con manoplas. La crítica lo llamó genio amortiguado. Mittens lo llamó prevenir la congelación."

#: data/songs.json:artists[smelter].name
msgid "Smelter Skelter"
msgstr "Smelter Skelter"

#: data/songs.json:artists[smelter].genre
msgid "Foundry industrial"
msgstr "Industrial de fundición"

#: data/songs.json:artists[smelter].bio
msgid "Brooding Anvil band who tuned their drums to the furnace roar. The Ledger tried to buy their catalogue; they melted the contract down and played the slag."
msgstr "Banda sombría de Anvil que afinaba sus tambores con el rugido de los hornos. El Ledger quiso comprar su catálogo; fundieron el contrato y tocaron la escoria."

#: data/songs.json:artists[ledger_audio].name
